 - `--format <json|markdown>` – output format (defaults to JSON). Markdown reports include human-readable summaries for review boards.
+- `--threshold <metric>=<min>` – gate on a metric minimum (e.g., `--threshold exact_match=0.9`). Can be used multiple times. A metric with no score fails its threshold. Exit code 1 if any threshold fails, 0 if all pass; exits 2 on usage errors (unknown metric, invalid format).
 
